Notable components:

- Termux terminal modules (com.termux.terminal, com.termux.view), originally
  from the Termux project. The Termux repository is GPL-3.0; its
  terminal-emulator and terminal-view modules retain their documented
  Apache-2.0 exception and copyright notices.
- Termux:X11 / Lorie, GPL-3.0-or-later.
- PRoot, GPL-2.0-only, distributed as a separate executable and not linked into
  the Trierarch app.
- virglrenderer and libepoxy, MIT.
- AdrenoTools (libadrenotools and hook libraries), BSD-2-Clause.
- Host Turnip v32, built from Mesa's Turnip/gen8 source and distributed as the
  Vulkan presenter driver for Adreno 6xx/7xx/8xx; Mesa per-file licenses
  (including MIT, BSD-3-Clause and SGI-B-2.0).
- Mesa 3D, the lfdevs/mesa-for-android-container Freedreno fork and the
  lfdevs/archlinuxarm-PKGBUILDs packaging, under Mesa's per-file licenses
