  patches/recipes are GPL-3.0 unless a file says otherwise.
- LLVM 21.1 runtime libraries, Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception.
- KWin compatibility library built from KDE KWin 6.8.2 with Trierarch's
  render-node patch, GPL-2.0-or-later / LGPL-2.1-or-later where applicable.
- ANGLE, BSD-3-Clause.
- PipeWire and WirePlumber, MIT.
- Local Desktop AAudio sink, GPL-3.0.
- Wayland and wayland-protocols, MIT.
- libffi, MIT.
- X.Org XKB data, X11-style license.
- DroidSpaces is an optional external runtime, GPL-3.0; it is not bundled by
  Trierarch.
- AndroidX and Kotlin, Apache-2.0.

KDE Plasma/KWin, Hyprland/aquamarine, XFCE and the Linux distributions are guest
environments provided by the user's rootfs or container. They keep their own
licenses and are not relicensed by Trierarch.

